cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "State of MCP"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "RoninForge"
    email: "jens@rasta.online"
    website: "https://roninforge.org"
abstract: >-
  A dated, keyless health and conformance census of the official Model Context
  Protocol registry. Every server is checked with the same public,
  unauthenticated probes (the registry, the public GitHub API, npm, PyPI,
  anonymous Docker Hub, and a capability-only MCP initialize/tools-list
  exchange) and given a verdict: healthy, degraded, dead, or unknown. Produced
  with akashi, reproducible row by row.
